\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\)</span> 是两个互异的零元逻辑构造子，不是词汇中的关系或常量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\">\\(t=u\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\doteq u\">\\(t\\doteq u\\)</span> 表示同一个相等构造子。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\coloneqq \\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\cup\\{t_1\\doteq t_2\\mid t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^{r}\\{R_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{a_i})\\mid t_1,\\ldots,t_{a_i}\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{AtFml}_S \\coloneqq \\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\cup\\{t_1\\doteq t_2\\mid t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^{r}\\{R_i(t_1,\\ldots,t_{a_i})\\mid t_1,\\ldots,t_{a_i}\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> : 所有原子公式的集合</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-atomic-formula-—-原子公式-$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$","text":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式 $\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-voca